DreamUIVirtualCursorSubsystem:GetVirtualCursorPosition {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/DreamUIVirtualCursor.h#DreamUIVirtualCursorSubsystem:GetVirtualCursorPosition
    src   "Where the first player's cursor is, in viewport coordinates. Meaningless while it is inactive."
    text  "第一个玩家的光标在视口坐标系中的位置。未激活时无意义。"
    state machine
}

DreamUIVirtualCursorSubsystem:SetConfirmPressed {
    at    Source/DreamGUIInput/Public/Interaction/DreamUIVirtualCursor.h#DreamUIVirtualCursorSubsystem:SetConfirmPressed
    src   "Push the first player's confirm button, as a left mouse button at their cursor. Edge-triggered: only a change\nfrom what was last pushed is delivered. The preset actor calls it after offering the key to the action\nrouter, so a confirm the router claimed never becomes a click."
    text  "将第一个玩家的确认按钮作为其光标处的鼠标左键按下。边沿触发：仅在相比上次按下的状态发生变化\n时才会传递。预设Actor在把按键提供给操作\n路由器后调用它，因此被路由器接管的确认操作不会变成点击。"
    state machine
}

